# r2-gaas.abi with 4 more bands than its 15 (nbdbuf 4: tolwfr holds on the first 15, the ones compared).
# The engine's upright frame (Cell::upright: a1 on +x, a2 in the xy plane): ABINIT's 12 x 13 on-site mesh is not
# rotation-invariant, so ABINIT and the engine evaluate it in one frame. r2-gaas-original-frame.abi is the same
# crystal in the conventional frame (5.65 Angstrom fcc); xred is unchanged (DESIGN-X2.md M0.1).
acell 3*1.0 Angstrom
rprim 3.995153313703994 0.000000000000000 0.000000000000000  1.997576656851997 3.459904261681239 0.000000000000000  1.997576656851997 1.153301420560413 3.262029020921386
natom 2
ntypat 2
znucl 31 33
typat 1 2
xred 0.0 0.0 0.0  0.26 0.24 0.255
pseudos "Ga/Ga.GGA_PBE-JTH.xml, As/As.GGA_PBE-JTH.xml"
ecut 12.0
pawecutdg 24.0
ngkpt 2 2 2
nshiftk 1
shiftk 0 0 0
occopt 1
nband 19
nbdbuf 4
istwfk 8*1
iscf 17
ixc -497498
usekden 1
pawxcdev 0
